      "exactMatch": "https://chicagoplaygrounds.com/s/guide/item/3425",
      "definition": { "ja": "梁の下に輪が 1 つだけ吊られて回る" },
      "editorialNote": { "ja": "シカゴの説明に合わせた。Vancouver で見たことはない" },
      "prefLabel": { "en": "Single Overhead Spinning Ring", "ja": "回る輪の雲梯（輪 1 つ）" }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://play.ldas.jp/vocab/#post-spinning-ring",
